{
    "chapter_num": 2,
    "verses_count": 18,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Do Not Neglect Salvation"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore we must give "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "all the more careful attention"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the more earnest heed to the things we have heard, lest we drift away. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For if the word spoken through angels proved steadfast, and every transgression and disobedience received a just "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "retribution or penalty"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "reward, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "how shall we escape if we neglect so great a salvation, which at the first began to be spoken by the Lord, and was confirmed to us by those who heard "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Him,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "God also bearing witness both with signs and wonders, with various miracles, and gifts"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "distributions"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the Holy Spirit, according to His own will?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Son Made Lower than Angels"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For He has not put the world to come, of which we speak, in subjection to angels. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But one testified in a certain place, saying:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“What is man that You are mindful of him,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "Or the son of man that You take care of him?"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "You have made him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or for a little while"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "a little lower than the angels;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "You have crowned him with glory and honor,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M omit the rest of v. 7."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "And set him over the works of Your hands."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "You have put all things in subjection under his feet.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For in that He put all in subjection under him, He left nothing "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not put under him. But now we do not yet see all things put under him. "
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But we see Jesus, who was made "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or for a little while"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "a little lower than the angels, for the suffering of death crowned with glory and honor, that He, by the grace of God, might taste death for everyone."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Bringing Many Sons to Glory"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For it was fitting for Him, for whom "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " all things and by whom "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " all things, in bringing many sons to glory, to make the captain of their salvation perfect through sufferings. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For both He who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "sets apart"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "sanctifies and those who are being sanctified "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " all of one, for which reason He is not ashamed to call them brethren, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "saying:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“I will declare Your name to My brethren;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "In the midst of the assembly I will sing praise to You.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And again:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“I will put My trust in Him.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And again:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“Here am I and the children whom God has given Me.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Inasmuch then as the children have partaken of flesh and blood, He Himself likewise shared in the same, that through death He might destroy him who had the power of death, that is, the devil, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and release those who through fear of death were all their lifetime subject to bondage. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For indeed He does not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or take on the nature of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "give aid to angels, but He does "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or take on"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "give aid to the seed of Abraham. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, in all things He had to be made like "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "His"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " brethren, that He might be a merciful and faithful High Priest in things "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "pertaining"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to God, to make propitiation for the sins of the people. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For in that He Himself has suffered, being "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "tested"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "tempted, He is able to aid those who are tempted."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}